      "summary_en": "Rek'Sai burrows into the ground, gaining new abilities and increased Move Speed. Her vision range is reduced and she cannot use basic attacks. While Burrowed, Rek'Sai may cast Unburrow to knock up and damage nearby enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "雷克塞遁入地下，提供新的技能并提升移动速度。她的视野距离会被降低并且无法进行普攻。 在地底时，雷克塞可以施放破土而出，击飞并伤害身边的敌人。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1331719:3980688",
        "source:wiki:1331720:4008007"
      ]
