      "summary_en": "Rek'Sai bites her target, dealing physical damage, or bonus true damage if she has max Fury. While Burrowed, Rek'Sai creates a re-usable, long lasting tunnel. Enemies can destroy it by standing on top of either entrance.",
      "summary_zh": "雷克塞噬咬她的目标，造成物理伤害，或是在满怒时造成额外真实伤害。 在地底时，雷克塞挖掘出一个可重复使用、长期存在的隧道。敌人踩在任一入口上即可摧毁整条隧道。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1331722:4034704",
        "source:wiki:1331723:4007778"
      ]
